+# Wire Format Policy
+
+No current decision on a wire serialisation format is recorded in this project's documentation. The repository's docs (`docs/doc.md`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`) describe several supported binding and rendering formats (JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, ProtoBuf, MsgPack) as user-selectable options, but none of these is recorded as the project's chosen or mandated wire format, so no such value is stated here.
